= Yasmin Fahimi

Yasmin Fahimi, a chemist from Hanover, was general secretary of the SPD before she became chair of the DGB, the German trade union confederation. She argues that borrowing to invest is not a sin but a duty.

- @plan
- @carry_out_policy
- @union_unity
- @root: Return to main

@plan
title: Adopt the Zukunftsprogramm!
subtitle: Win the party over to the investment plan.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?][? if investment_support < 3 : There is not enough support in the party yet. ?][? if recession_seen == 0 : There is no economic crisis. ?]
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0 and investment_adopted == 0 and investment_support >= 3 and recession_seen
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6
go-to: crisis_program.plan_adopted

@carry_out_policy
title: Carry out the economic plan
subtitle: Put the plan into practice.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?][? if not investment_adopted : The party has not adopted the plan. ?][? if spd_in_government = 0 : We are not in government. ?]
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0 and investment_adopted and spd_in_government and investment_implemented <= 1
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; economic_policy_timer -= 12
go-to: economic_policy

@union_unity
title: Union-party coordination
subtitle: Bring the unions and the party closer together.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; labor_dissent -= 8; labor_strength += 3

Regular meetings between the DGB unions and the party leadership calm the AfA.

